// The peripheral delays: hooks a driver calls and the program supplies. A platform module (src/esp32/peripheral_delay_*)
// exports them under these C names with @export, and a host test stands in for it by exporting its own mock under
// the same names; the compiler checks that each @export has the signature declared here (docs/hook-mocking-design.md).
trusted noescape extern:"c" fun peripheralDelayMicroseconds(microseconds: int): void
trusted noescape extern:"c" fun peripheralDelayMilliseconds(milliseconds: int): void
